From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:13:07 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add live camera companion viewfinder (overlay/asteroidos)

Extend asteroid-camera with a low-latency live preview streamed from the
paired phone over Wi-Fi or Bluetooth:

- camera-companion.patch: add the companion stream integration and a
  dedicated QML video surface.
- camerastreamview.{h,cpp}: MJPEG/RTSP client and renderer tuned for the
  smartwatch display.

The camera derivation now carries the companion patch and links the Qt
Multimedia/Qt Base modules required by the viewfinder.
